! matvec_rect.tb - a 2 x 3 matrix times a 3-vector, and the transpose
! product. Column-major: a(1,1), a(2,1), a(1,2), a(2,2), a(1,3), a(2,3).
trebago matvec_rect
  in  a(m, n), x(n), v(m)
  out y(m), z(n)
  y(i) = sum(j, a(i, j) * x(j))
  z(j) = sum(i, a(i, j) * v(i))
end
!> case 2x3
!> in a(2,3) = 1, 4, 2, 5, 3, 6
!> in x = 1, 1/2, 1/3
!> in v = 1, -1
!> expect y = 3, 17/2
!> expect z = -3, -3, -3
!> case x has the wrong extent: refused before anything runs
!> in a(2,3) = 1, 4, 2, 5, 3, 6
!> in x = 1, 1/2
!> in v = 1, -1
!> refuse TB_E_SHAPE 7:16
